Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To happen so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose most of our lives\NEnd pretty much that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even saying bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just up and drop dead like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:04:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, lives you feeling kind of lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like little crybaby\NPolnareff is trying to talk tough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him provoke you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Avdol warn you about\Nthe danger of fighting alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But you ignored all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you're trying to take\Nrevenge even if it kills you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:05:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.35,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight when there's\Nabsolutely no way you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,At the moment, we don't really\Nunderstand the nature of their stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So just retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol was cowardly stabbed from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I should run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight a battle that\Nmay cost you your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Avdol was trying to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, just what the hell's all\Nthat jabbering about you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready whenever you are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ready to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up, Zondai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.13,0:05:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy, Avdol, died for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you owe him one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't been here, he\Nwouldn't have died, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.45,0:06:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, where's that bastard's main body?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Poledeth, just stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be sad, Palmerev.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see Avdol soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And your precious little sister as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.17,0:06:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When you meet your little sister again,\Nwhy don't you ask her how I killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to provoke you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for your\Nchariot to cut my hanged man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I exist inside the mirror, where\Nyour stand is unable to reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you frustrated?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whole horse, shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish off this idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sirreeee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff was shot by...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To save Polnareff's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they're out of\Nthe range of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it hits the target, it's\Ntoo far away for maximum impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.73,0:09:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Mr. J.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Giles hell-bent on ridding the\Nworld of that Polnareff fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.63,0:09:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could have avenged my sister's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have minded\Nbeing killed in the attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I think I understand\Nwhat Avdol tried to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,His sacrifice will not go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight and survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Polnareff, do you\Ntruly understand now? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's in lieu of\Nshaking hands to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're no longer just your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The next time they attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I will bring them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at a fair disadvantage by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been one to\Nbe the lone gunslinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, there'll be another chance later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I stabbed him with my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But apparently I missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt no resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand, the Hanged Man, can launch\Nan attack from any reflective surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the smallest fragment will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hanged Man attacks my\Nreflection from inside the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no way I can get myself\Ninto something like a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to\Nfight someone like him? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Palmadeth
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep saying things like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the world of the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no such world inside there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it too, didn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He exists in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you turn around, he's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but a mirror is just\Na reflection of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I don't need you to tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about\Ncommon knowledge here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If something like a stand can exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you it's not so strange\Nthat a world inside a mirror can exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you still have some\Nsort of a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I do think the mystery of his\Ntrue nature is somehow related to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow, his true nature\Nis also his greatest weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the chrome on the steering wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My chest really hurts, but I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from anything reflective.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.02,0:13:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He followed us here from mirror to\Nmirror by a series of reflections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflections, which means\Nit's actually light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Its true nature is a stand of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go near any reflective objects and\Nremove anything like that from your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers, it looks like\Nyou had a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You must need medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give you a discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In a child's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at us, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See, there's nothing wrong with us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get away from here, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Pull that F!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't poke this little boy's\Neyes out with your sword, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape now unless\Nyou poke out this boy's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Poke out this boy's eyes, you say? Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stabbing Avdol-san from behind and\Nnow using a child unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In this situation, you don't\Nuse a stock line like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, when the time comes to take\Nrevenge, this is the kind of line you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For all your crimes, for the\Nhonor of my sister's spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and so that my friend\NAbdel may rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Without fail, I will drive you\Nto the very depths of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There, in Polnareff's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.01,0:16:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how it works, but he\Ncan move at the speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, it's a speed\Nbeyond all recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that kid's eyes were to close, I\Nknew his next move would be to my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you can predict that path...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then cutting him with my sword is easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! The medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At last we meet, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. J. Guile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I figured out your Stan's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, your stand surprised me at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it was clearly visible, there\Nwas nothing I could do to counter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But once I understood its true\Nnature, it was no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can kiss your ass goodbye now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, allow me to finish you off slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not Jake Isle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Kyle, you're just a stupid\Nfool after all, eh, Boulder F?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know what I look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you carelessly approached,\Nthinking you'd won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's just a street peddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was cut him with a knife\Nin the same place you injured the hangman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.69,0:19:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, got around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,These travelers would like to\Ngive all of you some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.03,0:19:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you've figured out my stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.39,0:19:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my stand, so naturally\NI'm aware of its weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Increasing the number of reflective\Nobjects will make his path unpredictable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.17,0:20:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and no longer will it be vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stop looking at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can't escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.19,0:20:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,or are you going to create an exit by\Nslaughtering the poor innocent peddlers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, you sacrificed\Nyour youth to pursue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how sad that you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a lonely,\Nwretched life you've led.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.47,0:20:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,After you leave this world,\NI will live happily on in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.63,0:20:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Women at my feet,\Ncatering to my every need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it us they want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what an\Nentertaining little screamer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming up there right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, such words\Nare not appropriate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to\Ntake revenge, you shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,use words like bastard\Nyou say it like this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Noriyaki Kakyoin.\NSo that my friend Avdol Sol and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.49,0:21:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the soul of my friend Alnaref's\Nsister will rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,may Jay Gile atone for\Nthese crimes with his life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.09,0:21:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give that gold coin\Nto whoever picks it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gold coin, so shiny\Nyou can see your face in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.85,0:22:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A-a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-a-a-a-a!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who's so\Ngood at screaming, J. Guile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.33,0:22:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:23:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you say,\Nso please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.43,0:23:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister, my younger sister must\Nhave said the same thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But you killed her anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.77,0:23:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed her for your own sick pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have I waited for this moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,From here, you'll be\Nscreaming your way to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.85,0:23:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are things I can't\Nleave to the demons down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.93,0:24:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A very fitting end for\Nsomeone named the Hanged Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.15,0:24:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't no damn good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.25,0:24:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at a hell of a disadvantage alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.83,0:24:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a partner to back me up,\Nmy gunfighting skills can't shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.93,0:24:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to be number two than number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.51,0:24:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my philosophy in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.75,0:24:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I best get on out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.01,0:25:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro! Joseph-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.19,0:25:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We already know all about Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time was short, so we gave him\Na simple but proper burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.13,0:25:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what should we do with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.45,0:25:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard who stabbed Avdol\Nin the back was J. Guile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.71,0:25:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But this guy is the one who\Nfired the bullet that killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.71,0:25:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.95,0:25:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.97,0:25:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be the one to carry out justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.31,0:25:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.57,0:25:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you ask, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.55,0:26:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of them begging for their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.67,0:26:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you that you\Ncan't get off so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.41,0:26:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, prepare to learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please run, my dearest\NHo, Horse. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.63,0:26:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please run while I hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.03,0:26:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my only reason for living.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.43,0:26:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please escape while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.09,0:26:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.99,0:26:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I gladly accept your offer and will\Nlive on to see another sunrise. Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.23,0:26:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dearest hole horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.49,0:26:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm only running\Naway because I love you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.75,0:26:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we won't be able to go on\Nlike this, loving each other forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.85,0:26:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, baby. Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.93,0:26:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:26:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman! Stop it! Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.27,0:27:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But that bastard killed Avdol\Nand she helped him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We just can't afford to\Ngo chasing after him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.71,0:27:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate, but we don't have\Nthe time to make any side trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.07,0:27:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.35,0:27:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In keeping with Avdol-san's intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.61,0:27:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to put this matter aside for\Nnow and continue with our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.39,0:27:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.59,0:27:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.19,0:27:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,May your soul rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.61,0:27:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We will join you there soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.59,0:27:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.97,0:27:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue our journey to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.49,0:27:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Dio isn't going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.03,0:27:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If the four of us want to beat this enemy,\Nwe're going to have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.71,0:28:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If any one of us gets out of line,\Nhe's sure to take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.49,0:28:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.87,0:28:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he say something like that to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.55,0:28:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In his own way, he's dealing\Nwith the trouble he's caused,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.71,0:28:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,including the incident with Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.59,0:28:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.93,0:28:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Move it! Huh? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.75,0:28:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol, you wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I will avenge your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.81,0:29:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my son just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.83,0:29:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My dearest son, you perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.05,0:29:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body covered with horrible\Nwounds just like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.35,0:29:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it through the\Npain of the astigmata.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.91,0:29:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it, I'll fucking kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.59,0:29:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll damn well make sure I\Nkilled you with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.67,0:29:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With my own stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.55,0:29:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.49,0:30:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
